<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107047" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπείσ-ειμι</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶμι</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ibo) enter upon, succeed to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν αὐτῶν τάξιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Cod.Just.</u>
					1.3.41.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				1.77.18
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>succeed to</i> an office, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν
				πρωτοκωμητίαν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.1677.48
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀγαθῖνος εἰς τὴν τοιαύτην ὑπεισῄει
				διδασκαλίαν</span>
			<i>succeeded to,</i> i. e. came to give his authority to, this
			teaching, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.488
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>enter imperceptibly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τί τινα</span>
			<i>comes into</i> one's mind, <i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				8.17
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
